      "q": "How much does the federal government award through 8(a) set-asides?",
      "a": "8(a) set-asides obligated $9.2B in FY2026 to date. The program delivered 10,030 awards with an average award size of $916K, and obligations fell 32.9% year over year. Historical totals show obligations of $11.3B in FY21, $12.2B in FY22, $14.1B in FY23, $15.1B in FY24, and $13.7B in FY25."
    },
